forge Technology Limited", "sort_date": "2026-11-11 11:01:08", "symbol": "IDEAFORGE", "voiceSummary": "ideaForge Technology Limited filed the transcript of its earnings call for the quarter ended September 30, 2026, with BSE and NSE. The call was held on November 03, 2026. The company reported H1 FY '27 revenue of approximately INR 160 crore and Q2 revenue of approximately INR 91 crore. The company returned to profitability at the PAT level in Q2. It executed over 50% of its FY '27 opening order book. The company launched the ZOLT UCAV variant in October. It signed an agreement with the Technology Development Board for INR 151 crores in debt funding for the YETI program. The company mutually terminated a proposed joint venture agreement with First Breach in the U.S. No capital was contributed to the joint venture. The company continues to pursue U.S. market initiatives through its wholly-owned subsidiary.", "voiceUrl": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.in/ann_voice/IDEAFORGE_11112026110042_Transcript_Uploading_03112026.mp3"}, {"an_dt": "06-Nov-2026 10:46:09", "attFileSize": "656.89 KB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/IDEAFORGE_06112026104542_Monitoring_Agency_Report_30092026.pdf", "attchmntText": "Monitoring agency report for the quarter ended September 30, 2026", "bflag": null, "csvName": null, "desc": "Monitoring Agency Report", "difference": "00:00:00", "dt": "06112026104609", "exchdisstime": "06-Nov-2026 10:46:09", "fileSize": "656.89 KB", "hasXbrl": true, "old_new": null, "orgid": null, "seq_id": "106849402", "smIndustry": null, "sm_isin": "INE349Y01013", "sm_name": "Ideaforge Technology Limited", "sort_date": "2026-11-06 10:46:09", "symbol": "IDEAFORGE", "voiceSummary": null, "voiceUrl": null}, {"an_dt": "04-Nov-2026 09:25:50", "attFileSize": "247.59 KB", "attchmntFile": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/IDEAFORGE_04112026092536_Audio_Call_Uploading_03112026.pdf", "attchmntText": "Ideaforge Technology Limited has informed the